<prestashop xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink">
  <product_option_value>
    <id_attribute_group><![CDATA[{{id_option_taille}}]]></id_attribute_group>
    <name>
      <language id="1"><![CDATA[kely]]></language>
    </name>
  </product_option_value>
</prestashop>
### => id_val_kely = 27

@id_val_kely = 27

###

#### 3.3 - Valeur couleur : fotsy (blanc #FFFFFF)
